{"id":2722,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p><strong> &nbsp;</strong>为积极响应学校心理健康教育主题月号召，引导学生关注心理健康、涵养积极向上的心理品格，5月13日晚，我院在4号楼211会议室组织开展心理健康教育观影活动。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Wo7LHDnRVkUNWVMg478oRCDLNCaozNLYolLDMNQRnN-PL4U0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyDUYysL1h7UN-ZM8QknmQRL87anNLsLmU8U4QkM4vDnRTFoRv4UzWkLRAFU4W7oSb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vaLRlJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7005&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/56C72DBB87FBF6C3A0FC7244C6B776D9/873A2B08/C2D9\" vheight=\"219.3300018310547\" vwidth=\"292.3999938964844\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Wo7LHDnRVkUNWVMg478oRCDLNCaozNLYolLDMNQRnN-PL4U0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyDUYysL1h7UN-ZM8QknmQRL87anNLsLmU8U4QkM4vDnRTFoRv4UzWkLRAFU4W7oSb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vaLRlJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7005&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>影片内容贴近青年日常，聚焦情绪管理、心态调节、自我接纳等核心内容，情节温暖治愈，富有教育意义。观影过程中，大家认真投入，沉浸式感受影片传递的积极力量，在光影中感悟生活真谛，汲取心灵养分。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WUlrH7nmGZU8W7Lgz-ioRV7Lm7PUmlLaUmlaL7rRolMRoz-0gihFp2hmCIa0USyiUShRMShkMRLDL8l4UNlDU49PUzrVM8L4ozCYLNMRLNMFLmU8n7l4U8nFn7nVM1b/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vaLRlJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7005&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/A5AC5B4363E3BE6C81A5E7C39622CC2C/244DE3CD/DDE6\" vheight=\"224.8000030517578\" vwidth=\"299.7300109863281\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WUlrH7nmGZU8W7Lgz-ioRV7Lm7PUmlLaUmlaL7rRolMRoz-0gihFp2hmCIa0USyiUShRMShkMRLDL8l4UNlDU49PUzrVM8L4ozCYLNMRLNMFLmU8n7l4U8nFn7nVM1b/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vaLRlJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7005&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>此次活动将心理健康教育融入生动的影像叙事，既丰富了课余文化生活，又引导同学们正视内心情绪，学会疏导压力、关爱自我。今后，我院将常态化开展各类心理教育活动，把心理育人融入学院育人全过程，守护学子身心健康。</p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Wo7LHDnRVkUNWVMg478oRCDLNCaozNLYolLDMNQRnN-PL4U0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyDUYysL1h7UN-ZM8QknmQRL87anNLsLmU8U4QkM4vDnRTFoRv4UzWkLRAFU4W7oSb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vaLRlJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7005&e=.jpeg"}